                                                "text": "hi jack. you just missed the best hardcore/gabba party: \"thunderdome - a decade\", here in amsterdam. 2 huge rooms filled with 15.000 people (the party had sold out weeks in advance), one room for oldstyle (92-97), one for the newer hardcore/hardstyle (97-02)."
